cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SeedForge, please cite it as below, and cite the Nature paper that inspired it (see references)."
title: "SeedForge: an open-source modular manufacturing platform for moisture-responsive wooden self-burying seed carriers"
type: software
version: 0.3.0-alpha
date-released: "2026-10-11"
authors:
  - family-names: Norman
    given-names: Aleksander
  - name: "SeedForge contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Normansrule/seedforge"
url: "https://normansrule.github.io/seedforge/"
license:
  - MIT
  - CERN-OHL-S-2.0
  - CC-BY-SA-4.0
keywords:
  - seed carrier
  - hygromorphic wood
  - reforestation
  - open hardware
  - winding machine
  - computer vision
abstract: >-
  Research-prototype manufacturing platform (CAD, firmware, host software, simulator,
  deterministic vision QA, documentation) for winding wet wood veneer into helical
  seed-carrier bodies. Release v0.3.0-alpha is designed and software-tested but not
  physically validated.
